#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:1
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "ファームウェア"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:3
msgid ""
"Firmware refers to the embedded software written into Flexbar's internal "
"microcontroller, pre-installed at the factory. Updates to firmware are "
"prompted via FlexDesigner when available. We recommend regularly updating"
" to ensure access to the latest features and improved stability."
msgstr ""
"ファームウェアとは、Flexbar 内蔵マイコンに書き込まれた組み込みソフトウェアで、"
"工場出荷時にプリインストールされています。更新がある場合は FlexDesigner から"
"案内されます。最新機能と安定性向上のため、定期的な更新をおすすめします。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:5
msgid "Update your firmware"
msgstr "ファームウェアを更新する"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:7
msgid "Automatic Update"
msgstr "自動更新"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:9
msgid ""
"When a firmware update is available, FlexDesigner will display the "
"following prompt. We recommend updating as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"ファームウェアの更新が利用可能になると、FlexDesigner に次のような案内が表示"
"されます。できるだけ早めに更新することをおすすめします。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:11
msgid "![1743988092470](image/firmware/1743988092470.png)"
msgstr "![1743988092470](image/firmware/1743988092470.png)"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:11
msgid "1743988092470"
msgstr "1743988092470"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:13
msgid "Manual Update"
msgstr "手動更新"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:15
msgid ""
"**Under normal circumstances, you do not need to manually update your "
"firmware. If a necessary firmware update is available, FlexDesigner will "
"notify you.**"
msgstr ""
"**通常は手動でファームウェアを更新する必要はありません。必要な更新がある場合は、"
"FlexDesigner から通知されます。**"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:17
msgid "Go to `Setting -> Device`"
msgstr "`Setting -> Device` を開きます"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:19
msgid "![1743984789282](image/firmware/1743984789282.png)"
msgstr "![1743984789282](image/firmware/1743984789282.png)"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:19
msgid "1743984789282"
msgstr "1743984789282"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:21
msgid ""
"Click `UPLOAD FIRMWARE`, then wait for the firmware upload to complete "
"and the device to restart automatically."
msgstr ""
"`UPLOAD FIRMWARE` をクリックし、アップロードの完了とデバイスの自動再起動を待ち"
"ます。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:23
msgid "**Note: Do not disconnect power during the update process**"
msgstr "**注意: 更新中は電源を切らないでください**"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:25
msgid "After update, device shows \"Profile version does not match...\""
msgstr "更新後、デバイスに「Profile version does not match...」と表示される場合"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:27
msgid ""
"It's normal for your device to display this screen after an update. The "
"update requires you to re-upload your Profile to ensure the device is "
"running the latest version. You simply need to upload your Profile again "
"to resolve this."
msgstr ""
"更新後にこの画面が出るのは正常な動作です。デバイスを最新の状態で動かすため、"
"Profile を再アップロードする必要があります。Profile を再度アップロードすれば"
"解消します。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:29
msgid "![1746932309321](image/firmware/1746932309321.png)"
msgstr "![1746932309321](image/firmware/1746932309321.png)"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:29
msgid "1746932309321"
msgstr "1746932309321"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:31
msgid "Unable to update your firmware"
msgstr "ファームウェアを更新できない場合"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:33
msgid ""
"If your Flexbar is running older firmware (<2.1.1), there is a very small"
" chance that you may encounter an issue where Flexbar cannot update "
"correctly. Don't worry—simply follow these steps to successfully update "
"your Flexbar."
msgstr ""
"Flexbar のファームウェアが古い（2.1.1 未満）場合、ごくまれに正しく更新できない"
"ことがあります。心配いりません。次の手順に従えば、更新を完了できます。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:35
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in the `Update your firmware` section to update "
"your Flexbar normally, but please monitor the update process (takes less "
"than 1 minute)."
msgstr ""
"`Update your firmware` の手順に従って通常どおり更新してください。更新処理（1 分"
"未満）は目を離さないようにしてください。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:36
msgid ""
"After the update completes, Flexbar will automatically restart. During "
"device startup, a LOGO screen will appear. On the far left of this "
"screen, you will see `Enter Safe Mode`. Please click to enter Safe Mode "
"before the LOGO disappears. This step is crucial. If you fail to enter "
"Safe Mode in time, simply return to step 1, update the firmware again, "
"and try once more."
msgstr ""
"更新が完了すると、Flexbar は自動的に再起動します。デバイス"
"起動中に LOGO 画面が表示されます。画面の左端に "
"`Enter Safe Mode` があります。LOGO が消える前にクリックして Safe Mode "
"に入ってください。この手順は重要です。時間内に Safe Mode に入れなかっ"
"た場合は、手順 1 に戻り、ファームウェアを再度更新してから、"
"もう一度試してください。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:37
msgid ""
"Once in the device's Safe Mode interface, simply click Upload in the top-"
"right corner of FlexDesigner to update your profile once."
msgstr ""
"デバイスの Safe Mode 画面に入ったら、FlexDesigner 右上の Upload を一度クリック"
"して Profile を更新するだけです。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:39
msgid "Rollback"
msgstr "ロールバック"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:41
msgid ""
"If the updated firmware does not function properly, you can manually roll"
" back to the previous version."
msgstr ""
"更新後のファームウェアが正しく動作しない場合は、手動でひとつ前のバージョンに"
"戻せます。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:43
msgid "You generally do not need to perform this operation"
msgstr "通常、この操作は必要ありません"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:45
msgid "Rollback in Safe Mode"
msgstr "Safe Mode でロールバックする"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:47
#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:57
msgid "Swipe left on the screen"
msgstr "画面を左にスワイプします"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:49
msgid "![1743988771303](image/firmware/1743988771303.png)"
msgstr "![1743988771303](image/firmware/1743988771303.png)"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:49
msgid "1743988771303"
msgstr "1743988771303"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:51
#: ../../source/troubleshoting/firmware.md:61
msgid "Click `ROLLBACK` to revert to the previous firmware version"
msgstr "`ROLLBACK` をクリックして、ひとつ前のファームウェア バージョンに戻します"

